# Stata workflow: Persistent university intentions

This folder contains a cleaned, annotated version of the three Stata do-files.
The code constructs a cohort dataset, builds supplementary application and education
files, and creates the final person-year analysis sample.

## Files

- `00_config.do` —  restricted-data paths.
- `01_build_basic_sample.do` — cohort selection, parent linkage, and parental education.
- `02_build_supplementary_data.do` — university applications, exam grades, matriculation, and polytechnic enrolment.
- `03_build_final_analysis_sample.do` — follow-up construction, merges, PGS variables, parental characteristics, and mental-health measures.

## Running the workflow

1. Edit every placeholder path in `00_config.do`.
2. Open Stata in Statistic Finland secure fiona environment.
3. Run the numbered do-files in order.

## Data availability

We use Finnish register data that cannot be shared in any circumstances according to the strict rules of Statistics Finland.

